WEBVTT

00:08.220 --> 00:10.660
I would like to see her as soon as possible.

00:11.150 --> 00:12.410
Where is Mother?

00:13.430 --> 00:16.260
I will not allow you and Colette to meet.

00:17.600 --> 00:18.540
Why is that?

00:18.930 --> 00:20.950
Why won't you let me meet my mother?

00:21.570 --> 00:26.440
Even though she is my mother, even though I have always tried my best to meet her...

00:26.680 --> 00:30.340
Since you know I am the real Nadja, quickly let me see...

00:30.390 --> 00:31.740
Don't be mistaken.

00:33.320 --> 00:38.980
I have searched for you as the successor to the Preminger Dukedom.

00:39.220 --> 00:42.930
Mother or daughter...that doesn't have any meaning.

00:43.890 --> 00:48.230
To me, there was no meaning in coming here if I can't meet my mother.

00:50.410 --> 00:51.440
Where are you going?

00:51.940 --> 00:54.510
If you won't let me meet her, then I will search for her myself.

00:56.310 --> 00:59.070
I have done so until now and gotten this far.

01:03.670 --> 01:04.830
NAAJA

01:03.670 --> 01:04.830
Nadja

01:04.860 --> 01:07.330
kimi no hitomi ni wa

01:04.880 --> 01:07.330
With your eyes

01:07.330 --> 01:08.490
NAAJA

01:07.380 --> 01:08.490
Nadja

01:08.510 --> 01:10.760
nani ga mieru

01:08.510 --> 01:10.760
What do you see?

01:10.980 --> 01:13.870
haruka tooku hikaru

01:10.980 --> 01:13.870
Shining in the far distance,

01:14.020 --> 01:16.160
mirai no tobira

01:14.020 --> 01:16.160
The door to the future,

01:17.300 --> 01:20.710
sagashiteiru

01:17.300 --> 01:20.710
That's what I'm searching for

01:20.710 --> 01:27.920
Tomorrow's Nadja

01:28.630 --> 01:32.040
If everyone could meet with a smile

01:32.140 --> 01:35.400
arasoimo kitto nakunaru

01:32.140 --> 01:35.400
I'm sure there would be no more fighting

01:35.470 --> 01:38.850
kon nani mo tanoshiku naru

01:35.500 --> 01:38.850
It could be so much more fun

01:38.880 --> 01:42.330
sekai wa hiruikedo hitotsune

01:38.880 --> 01:42.330
The world is wide, but it's still one

01:42.700 --> 01:46.060
tabi no owari wa mienai

01:42.700 --> 01:46.060
I can't see the end of the journey

01:46.090 --> 01:49.250
kamisama ga tabun shitteru

01:46.090 --> 01:49.250
God is the only one who can possibly know

01:49.420 --> 01:53.070
itsukamata deaeru hito tachi ni

01:49.420 --> 01:53.070
To the people who, someday, I will meet again

01:53.070 --> 01:55.220
te wo furinagara

01:53.070 --> 01:55.220
I will go waving

01:55.370 --> 02:02.110
toki ni wa BURUU ni naru himo aru kedo

01:55.370 --> 02:02.110
Sometimes, there are days I feel blue,

02:02.110 --> 02:04.850
ushiro mukanai

02:02.110 --> 02:04.850
But I won't look back

02:05.120 --> 02:10.160
yume ga kanau hima de

02:05.120 --> 02:10.160
Until the day my dream comes true

02:10.330 --> 02:13.710
NAAJA kimi no hoho emi wa

02:10.330 --> 02:13.710
Nadja, your smile

02:13.790 --> 02:16.990
NAAJA yuuki ni naru

02:13.790 --> 02:16.990
Nadja, you give me courage

02:17.290 --> 02:20.250
aoi sora no shita de

02:17.290 --> 02:20.250
Under the blue sky

02:20.230 --> 02:23.040
ashita no yukue

02:20.230 --> 02:23.040
I will find the place

02:23.560 --> 02:27.190
mitsu kerukara

02:23.560 --> 02:27.190
Where my future lies

02:32.570 --> 02:33.930
What are you doing?

02:34.100 --> 02:36.100
Let me go!

02:36.500 --> 02:38.400
I said let me go!

02:43.800 --> 02:44.590
Wait!

02:45.950 --> 02:47.380
Open up!

02:47.750 --> 02:50.960
Until the master says other wise, please wait here.

02:51.380 --> 02:52.000
No!

02:59.430 --> 03:03.380
Even if I'm locked in here, I won't give up.

03:09.000 --> 03:13.480
The New Door of Destiny

03:15.120 --> 03:16.600
What a girl!

03:18.400 --> 03:20.080
I apologize for saying this but...

03:20.770 --> 03:24.330
She is not allowed to meet Mistress Colette after coming this far...

03:25.410 --> 03:26.970
I...am terribly sorry.

03:28.300 --> 03:33.360
For the sake of the Preminger House, Colette and Nadja must not meet.

03:35.260 --> 03:36.790
Those two resemble each other.

03:37.140 --> 03:41.630
They don't even understand the value of protecting this House's traditions.

03:42.620 --> 03:45.460
Nadja will become the successor of this House.

03:46.150 --> 03:51.060
In order to make her behave as befits the Dukedom, she needs a firm upbringing.

03:51.850 --> 04:00.620
If I let her meet Colette, who believes similarly as she does, that girl will continue taking actions unbefitting a noble.

04:01.280 --> 04:07.920
In this Dukedom, we have the tradition of bringing up our successor firmly and with no softness.

04:08.570 --> 04:12.610
Furthermore, there is a Swiss school for the aristocracy.

04:13.360 --> 04:16.520
Make arrangements to have Nadja enrolled at that school.

04:20.960 --> 04:22.320
Um, excuse me.

04:28.090 --> 04:29.160
Mistress Colette!

04:31.130 --> 04:35.150
I heard from Oscar that the real Nadja was here.

04:37.800 --> 04:39.080
Where is Nadja?

04:39.750 --> 04:41.130
I cannot say...

04:41.800 --> 04:44.090
Because father's orders are absolute?

04:45.620 --> 04:52.410
You followed father's orders and created the lie about Nadja being dead, which pulled us both apart.

04:53.720 --> 04:56.260
Do you intend to repeat it?

04:58.530 --> 04:59.640
A woman's voice.

05:06.680 --> 05:07.420
Mother...

05:08.480 --> 05:09.450
Lady Nadja...

05:10.330 --> 05:11.990
Is in the upper room.

05:13.940 --> 05:14.750
Thank you.

05:15.350 --> 05:17.250
Mother!

05:18.630 --> 05:19.250
Nadja.

05:20.850 --> 05:22.260
Mother!

05:23.790 --> 05:24.800
Mother!

05:25.170 --> 05:26.010
Nadja!

05:26.110 --> 05:28.730
Mother! Mother!

05:30.530 --> 05:31.570
Mother!

05:32.680 --> 05:34.820
Mother...!

05:37.740 --> 05:38.800
Mother!

05:39.100 --> 05:40.080
Nadja!

05:40.750 --> 05:42.080
Mother...

05:49.370 --> 05:51.240
I've always wanted to meet you...

05:52.920 --> 05:53.730
Mother...

05:54.620 --> 05:55.610
You are warm.

06:00.380 --> 06:03.240
Mother...you have a nice fragrance.

06:04.000 --> 06:04.870
Nadja...

06:16.250 --> 06:20.570
Nadja is my daughter before she is the successor to the Dukedom.

06:21.480 --> 06:22.870
Tell this to my father...

06:23.730 --> 06:27.560
That her mother has come to take her home.

06:30.770 --> 06:32.720
Don't be reckless, okay?

06:33.010 --> 06:33.430
Huh?

06:33.930 --> 06:35.330
You flew through the sky.

06:36.620 --> 06:37.460
I'm sorry.

06:39.360 --> 06:42.020
You are always so surprising.

06:42.960 --> 06:47.310
We also got along from the beginning when we met at Dover.

06:48.340 --> 06:50.470
When we were together there...

06:51.280 --> 06:54.070
I thought it would be great if Nadja was a girl like you.

06:54.840 --> 06:55.650
Me too!

06:57.400 --> 06:58.510
I thought that too.

06:59.160 --> 07:01.650
It would be wonderful if this lady were my mother.

07:08.560 --> 07:12.710
It was really painful when I thought you had died.

07:14.710 --> 07:21.420
I used to speak with my sweet Nadja in heaven.

07:22.930 --> 07:24.190
I was the same.

07:24.680 --> 07:30.410
I also spoke to father and mother in heaven.

07:32.210 --> 07:34.610
Parent and child resemble each other, after all.

07:36.430 --> 07:39.320
Where did you and father first meet?

07:40.090 --> 07:40.900
In Vienna.

07:41.670 --> 07:45.540
We met by chance at my first ball and danced a waltz.

07:45.990 --> 07:48.140
That's great! Me too!

07:48.930 --> 07:52.260
I danced with Francis on my first ball.

07:52.610 --> 07:53.570
Francis?

07:53.740 --> 07:55.990
Is that the person that you like?

07:59.570 --> 08:00.430
Actually...

08:01.170 --> 08:03.790
There is another person named Keith.

08:04.600 --> 08:08.110
Keith has risked his life to help me.

08:09.760 --> 08:14.750
I...have come to not understand my own feelings anymore.

08:22.850 --> 08:24.380
There is no way you could forget.

08:24.770 --> 08:25.240
Huh?

08:26.200 --> 08:28.450
Now is not the time for that.

08:29.170 --> 08:32.850
Francis or Keith, which one is your man of destiny...

08:33.390 --> 08:36.130
Or whether that person is someone else.

08:36.870 --> 08:39.590
When the time comes, you will know it naturally.

08:45.490 --> 08:48.180
Nadja, you danced before, right?

08:48.470 --> 08:49.900
In the Dandelion Troupe.

08:50.280 --> 08:50.740
Yeah!

08:51.240 --> 08:54.000
Ever since my time in Applefield, I have loved dancing.

08:54.720 --> 08:56.000
Even far before that.

08:56.180 --> 08:56.520
Hm?

08:57.610 --> 09:03.660
When you were a baby and your father played the piano, you always danced.

09:04.170 --> 09:05.330
Is that right?

09:05.680 --> 09:09.280
I have liked dancing ever since I was a baby.

09:10.890 --> 09:12.020
Somehow it makes me happy.

09:18.990 --> 09:20.100
Ah, that's right.

09:20.520 --> 09:21.040
Hm?

09:21.830 --> 09:24.590
Mother, please watch me dance.

09:29.920 --> 09:31.800
Mother...you know...

09:32.390 --> 09:35.700
In order to dance in front of so many customers, I have always thought...

09:36.930 --> 09:40.000
My mother could be someone in the crowd.

09:40.880 --> 09:43.600
She might be watching my dance.

09:44.410 --> 09:45.230
Nadja...

09:45.870 --> 09:49.450
You have looked all around the world.

09:50.040 --> 09:52.980
I couldn't have done all of those things.

10:10.260 --> 10:13.920
I wonder what path you will walk in the future.

10:14.430 --> 10:15.920
Everyone from the Dandelion Troupe...

10:17.080 --> 10:20.260
I am dancing before my mother right now!

10:31.470 --> 10:36.010
Colette came to make Nadja a lady of the Waldmüller House.

10:37.440 --> 10:41.220
Tell Colette that I understand her feelings very well.

10:41.670 --> 10:42.110
What?

10:43.070 --> 10:45.840
But since she is also my granddaughter...

10:46.480 --> 10:51.220
I would at least like to give Nadja a party for coming back.

10:52.130 --> 10:52.800
Yes, sir.

10:54.160 --> 11:00.250
At the party I will announce Nadja as the successor to the Dukedom in front of all the nobles.

11:00.480 --> 11:04.030
And then I will take her to the Swiss school just like that.

11:04.580 --> 11:09.360
I will definitely give her an education that makes her a suitable successor.

11:10.380 --> 11:12.430
No matter what means I have to use.

11:33.230 --> 11:34.320
Good night.

11:34.640 --> 11:35.600
Good night.

11:44.050 --> 11:44.960
Is someone there?

11:49.130 --> 11:49.800
Keith...

11:51.230 --> 11:51.950
Keith!

11:52.610 --> 11:53.230
Nadja!

11:55.060 --> 11:55.970
Francis!

12:00.390 --> 12:02.930
I wanted to talk to you.

12:03.380 --> 12:05.750
About what we will do from now on.

12:06.370 --> 12:06.810
Huh?

12:07.010 --> 12:10.360
Until now, we have tried to make all people equal.

12:10.760 --> 12:13.100
I with Nobless Oblige...

12:13.570 --> 12:16.290
And Keith with the mask of the Black Rose.

12:17.180 --> 12:18.930
The Black Rose has disappeared.

12:19.520 --> 12:20.310
Forever.

12:21.770 --> 12:26.040
I think we should do something different from those two from now on.

12:26.660 --> 12:30.090
We've both been thinking about that.

12:30.530 --> 12:31.100
Yeah!

12:35.220 --> 12:38.090
If you two cooperate, you can do anything.

12:39.570 --> 12:40.190
Nadja.

12:41.740 --> 12:44.460
I didn't want you to become a noble.

12:45.870 --> 12:48.190
But since it's you, Nadja, then it's alright.

12:48.900 --> 12:52.880
Even if you become a member of the Preminger House, you will continue living by your own will.

12:53.860 --> 12:55.050
Different from my mother.

12:56.060 --> 12:56.850
You know, I...

12:58.310 --> 13:00.010
I wanted to tell you something.

13:01.570 --> 13:05.100
I think your mother was definitely not unhappy.

13:06.600 --> 13:10.950
Keith, the mother you saw as a child was really sad...

13:11.640 --> 13:14.380
But she wasn't sad all the time, was she?

13:15.220 --> 13:20.920
When I thought it was hopeless, I would become very sad.

13:22.400 --> 13:24.920
But after a while I would get cheered up again.

13:25.780 --> 13:28.800
If I dance my beloved dance, it will cheer me up.

13:29.510 --> 13:33.930
I have come to know a lot of people and have learned a lot of things on my journey.

13:34.970 --> 13:39.830
Humans can wear different faces and happiness can also look different.

13:40.820 --> 13:44.350
Therefore Keith, I think that your mother was definitely happy.

13:45.440 --> 13:48.770
After all, she raised two wonderful sons.

13:49.880 --> 13:53.530
Keith, don't you remember your mother's smile?

13:59.680 --> 14:00.150
Um...

14:00.870 --> 14:02.150
Sorry about that.

14:02.960 --> 14:05.330
You are always trying your best, right?

14:06.350 --> 14:07.800
Thank you, Nadja.

14:11.140 --> 14:12.520
I also thank you.

14:13.090 --> 14:13.780
Thank you.

14:16.590 --> 14:17.650
Then, me too.

14:18.540 --> 14:20.100
You two, thank you.

14:37.850 --> 14:40.790
It's been a long time since I saw you smile like that.

14:42.000 --> 14:45.850
Why didn't you tell Nadja that you will be going into hiding for a while?

14:48.590 --> 14:49.990
I was worried, that's why.

14:50.410 --> 14:51.030
But...

14:51.650 --> 14:54.560
While I'm away, I don't want you to have an opening.

14:55.230 --> 14:56.240
I understand.

14:56.830 --> 14:59.450
I want to fight fairly with you, after all.

15:01.600 --> 15:03.870
As usual, you are overly serious.

15:04.580 --> 15:05.570
It's my nature.

15:09.250 --> 15:10.140
Thank you very much!

15:10.810 --> 15:11.840
Thank you very much!

15:14.480 --> 15:15.840
Please come again!

15:16.260 --> 15:17.400
Please come again.

15:17.820 --> 15:18.460
Say...

15:19.000 --> 15:22.090
The dancing girl from before, is she having a day off?

15:25.820 --> 15:31.150
She was an angel who lost her way, but now she has returned to heaven.

15:57.170 --> 15:57.910
Dear guests...

15:58.580 --> 16:02.550
I am grateful that you have all attended despite your busy schedules.

16:03.370 --> 16:07.020
I am happy to announce that my granddaughter who, due to certain circumstances, has lived at a distance...

16:07.460 --> 16:12.230
She has now returned to Vienna. I would like to announce her arrival...

16:13.930 --> 16:14.940
Nadja.

16:44.690 --> 16:46.200
What is with that clothing?

16:47.480 --> 16:49.330
It's the clothing that I like the best.

16:52.370 --> 16:54.250
I must apologize.

16:55.970 --> 16:59.060
She is, after all, a girl who is not used to such places.

17:00.690 --> 17:01.680
Well then, everyone...

17:02.810 --> 17:13.010
I would like to announce Nadja Preminger as the official successor to the Preminger House.

17:13.680 --> 17:14.660
Father...

17:18.420 --> 17:20.960
I also have something to tell everyone.

17:22.510 --> 17:25.750
I have no intention to succeed the Preminger House.

17:27.550 --> 17:29.940
I will not allow you to refuse.

17:30.660 --> 17:31.250
No!

17:32.810 --> 17:37.620
The only reason why I wanted you to recognize me as Nadja was so that I could meet my mother.

17:38.310 --> 17:41.600
The Preminger House, or being the successor...I don't care about that.

17:42.120 --> 17:43.100
Quite something.

17:43.400 --> 17:45.230
As expected from my rose bud.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.000
Nadja...

17:47.690 --> 17:50.530
Because of the Preminger House you treasured so much...

17:50.930 --> 17:55.030
Mother had to leave because you were against her marriage.

17:55.620 --> 17:58.950
When I was a baby, you separated me from my mother.

18:00.260 --> 18:04.900
Don't you understand how many sorrowful times we have been through?

18:05.540 --> 18:11.000
The traditions of the Preminger House that have been kept for several hundred years...

18:11.320 --> 18:13.320
I will never allow you to change them.

18:14.010 --> 18:17.470
I will make your incorrect thoughts disappear.

18:19.290 --> 18:20.830
Take this girl.

18:23.660 --> 18:25.050
This conversation isn't finished.

18:28.820 --> 18:32.060
I can't be at ease if you approach a lady like that.

18:32.580 --> 18:33.610
Everyone!

18:33.880 --> 18:35.170
Why you...!

18:36.180 --> 18:36.670
Move!

18:36.850 --> 18:37.340
Nadja!

18:37.390 --> 18:39.020
You...

18:46.450 --> 18:47.120
Keith.

18:48.890 --> 18:50.470
What do you think you're--

18:50.470 --> 18:52.050
Enough, grandfather!

18:54.250 --> 18:58.570
That the dukedom is more important than people's happiness...that's wrong.

18:59.950 --> 19:05.360
I traveled with the Dandelion Troupe and met a lot of great people.

19:05.660 --> 19:09.680
Everyone treasured themselves and the people around them.

19:10.180 --> 19:12.370
They gave it their best every day.

19:13.830 --> 19:15.480
I understand now.

19:16.100 --> 19:19.900
Rather than being a noble, I want to see the wide world.

19:20.820 --> 19:24.960
I want to live every single day differently from yesterday.

19:26.250 --> 19:29.780
Because tomorrow is connected to the distant future.

19:30.320 --> 19:31.280
Be silent!

19:31.880 --> 19:34.020
What you are saying is absurd.

19:34.620 --> 19:36.670
Even if it's absurd right now...

19:37.750 --> 19:41.480
That's right...if a hundred years pass, it will definitely come.

19:42.520 --> 19:46.420
An era where people can more freely choose their way of life.

19:47.110 --> 19:48.860
I believe in that.

19:49.900 --> 19:50.740
That's right.

19:51.400 --> 19:54.840
You aren't suited for this narrow world of nobles.

19:55.110 --> 19:55.970
Colette!

19:56.830 --> 19:59.060
I don't understand what you're saying at all.

19:59.480 --> 20:01.620
What exactly do you intend to do?

20:02.290 --> 20:02.910
I...

20:03.800 --> 20:04.460
I...

20:05.600 --> 20:07.970
I will go back to being a dancer for the Dandelion Troupe.

20:14.310 --> 20:16.730
This is the new century's sort of girl!

20:16.980 --> 20:18.460
How wonderful, Nadja.

20:19.080 --> 20:19.720
Nadja...

20:20.910 --> 20:24.070
Mother...No matter how far away we are from each other...

20:24.360 --> 20:26.510
You will always be my daughter.

20:30.340 --> 20:30.850
Right!

20:32.580 --> 20:34.680
Take care, Nadja.

20:35.500 --> 20:38.140
I'm going, Mother.

21:00.280 --> 21:01.420
What a girl.

21:02.310 --> 21:07.910
She is like you, Father. Once she thinks of something, nothing can stop her.

21:12.330 --> 21:13.540
She resembles you.

21:14.800 --> 21:17.460
Yes. She is my daughter, after all.

21:18.920 --> 21:19.910
And also...

21:20.600 --> 21:22.280
She is your granddaughter.

21:32.330 --> 21:33.630
I've decided.

21:34.380 --> 21:36.750
Even if the goddess of fate says no...

21:37.630 --> 21:40.150
I will go forth and open the door of destiny.

21:41.110 --> 21:43.340
I will at once face towards tomorrow.

21:44.050 --> 21:45.760
Nadja!

21:46.500 --> 21:47.610
Everyone!

21:53.040 --> 21:54.570
Long, long ago...

21:54.790 --> 21:57.430
A story from a hundred years ago...

21:57.900 --> 22:05.160
What tomorrow might await Nadja, who has opened the new door of destiny by herself?

22:05.850 --> 22:09.040
That is another story.

22:13.480 --> 22:16.740
RONDON donyori haretara PARI

22:13.480 --> 22:16.740
Paris is sunnier than London

22:16.910 --> 22:19.930
KARUMEN menyori PAERIYA suki

22:16.910 --> 22:19.930
Carmen likes paella more than pasta

22:20.370 --> 22:26.570
SUPEEDO no jyoou kimagure yasan

22:20.370 --> 22:26.570
The Queen of Spades is a fickle person

22:27.480 --> 22:28.740
kitto

22:27.480 --> 22:28.740
Indeed

22:31.500 --> 22:33.970
nayan datte muda yo

22:31.500 --> 22:33.970
It's no use worrying about it

22:34.020 --> 22:37.630
kesera sera sera sera

22:34.020 --> 22:37.630
Que sera sera, sera sera

22:37.870 --> 22:42.560
ashita nante itsumo naru youni

22:37.870 --> 22:42.560
Tomorrow's going to be whatever it was meant

22:42.660 --> 22:44.020
naru naru

22:42.660 --> 22:44.020
To be, to be

22:44.420 --> 22:49.350
sekai kaeru tobi KONKUURU

22:44.420 --> 22:49.350
The tree frog won.

22:49.850 --> 22:53.800
yuushou shita yo amagaeru

22:49.850 --> 22:53.800
The world frog jumping contest

22:56.980 --> 23:03.130
koneko chan no ashi no urawa

22:56.980 --> 23:03.130
Under the kitten's paw

23:03.600 --> 23:09.720
otentou sama no nioi da ne

23:03.600 --> 23:09.720
Is the scent of the sun, right?

23:12.580 --> 23:15.940
RONDON don yori haretara PARI

23:12.580 --> 23:15.940
Paris is sunnier than London

23:15.990 --> 23:18.950
